	"content_pages": [
		{
			"ref_slug": "cp-whats-included",
			"title": "What's included",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What's included in your plan</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your site needs looking after whether or not anything goes wrong. Most of that work happens in the background, so here is what we do and how often.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Backups</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Taken daily and stored away from your hosting, so a problem with the server never takes the backups with it. We keep the last 30 days. If you ever want a copy of one, ask and we will send it over.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Updates</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WordPress, your plugins and your theme are updated every week. Anything significant goes onto a staging copy first so we can check nothing breaks before it reaches the live site.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Security</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The site sits behind a firewall and is scanned for malware. If something does get through, cleaning it up is covered.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Uptime monitoring</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We check the site every five minutes, day and night. The alert comes to us rather than to you, so most of the time you will never know there was a wobble.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Small changes</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Four small changes a month are included. Text edits, swapping an image, adding a page, updating your opening hours. They reset on the 1st and do not roll over. Anything larger gets a price before we start.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Setup note: make the numbers yours</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Rewrite each section to match what you actually do, and delete any you do not offer. The figures here are common but not universal. Some plans count changes, others sell a block of hours; use whichever you bill. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-yellow\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-yellow\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">⚡️ Quick tip</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Send the monthly report in the quiet months too, especially then. Care plans get cancelled when a client cannot see what they are paying for, and a month where nothing broke is a month your work succeeded. Put the boring numbers in it: updates applied, backups taken, uptime. The page you are reading does the same job, which is why it is worth keeping accurate.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
			"post_name": "cp-whats-included",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "cp-request-a-change",
			"title": "Request a change",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Request a change</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Send anything you want changed on the site and we will pick it up.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What counts as a small change</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Text edits, swapping an image, adding or updating a page, changing your opening hours or contact details, publishing a post you have written.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What needs a price first</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>New features, design work, anything needing a plugin you do not already have, or a job bigger than an hour. We will tell you before we start and give you a figure.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to send one</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Say which page it is on</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tell us what it should say, word for word where you can</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Flag it if there is a date it has to be live by</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If the change needs images or a document, upload them in Send us files on the portal home and mention it here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long it takes</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Small changes are usually live within three working days. If something is time sensitive, say so and we will move it up the list.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Setup note: two ways to take requests</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Leave the comment thread on and everything stays in the portal, attached to this page, where you and the client can both see the history. Comments are off by default: <a href=\"https://client-portal.io/support/enable-comments-in-your-portals-y8q7z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">how to enable comments in your portals</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Or turn the thread off and paste in an embed from your form tool instead. That suits you better if requests need to land in a ticketing system or a shared inbox. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
			"post_name": "cp-request-a-change",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "cp-common-questions",
			"title": "Common questions",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Common questions</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The things people ask us most in the first few months of a plan.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion -->\n<div role=\"group\" class=\"wp-block-accordion\"><!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What happens if my site goes down?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We find out within about five minutes and start looking straight away. You do not need to report it, though you are welcome to.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Do I need to do anything?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No. The plan runs in the background. The only time you will hear from us is the monthly report, or if something needs a decision from you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Can I still edit the site myself?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, it is your site. Tell us if you install a plugin or change something structural, so an update does not collide with it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What if I need more than my plan covers?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Send it anyway. If it is bigger than your monthly allowance we will price it before starting, and you can decide then.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Can I have a copy of my backup?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Any time. Ask and we will send you the most recent one, or one from a specific date if you need to go further back.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What happens if I cancel?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The plan stops at the end of the month you have paid for and the site stays yours. We will send you a final backup and hand over anything you do not already have.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not covered here? Send it over and we will get you an answer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#\">Ask us a question</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Setup note</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Swap these for the questions you actually get asked twice a month, and point the button at your contact page. The cancellation answer is worth keeping honest; it is the one clients read most carefully. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
			"post_name": "cp-common-questions",
			"meta": []
		}
	],
	"navigations": [
		{
